{"version":1,"content":"<p>天王郭富城昨天（26日）61歲生日，太太方媛在社交平台曬出一家五口溫馨全家福，並寫道：\"Happy birthday, my love.\"。</p><p>型佬城城穿恤衫打呔，跟3位千金及老婆合照，獲網民讚他狀態似40歲，城城還抱住孻女郭詠心（Cheryl），亦是Cheryl首度正面亮相。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:42:30.134788+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T09:01:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T12:38:16.914853+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:15.487442+00:00","content_hash":"ab3f96f739171cf760b7d0b350b33406b73d3e36a38c6f2c730a70f9f836447d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}